{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0102_1000_p", "source_sha256": "57cf7bf6b6d7a8533faf91babdad482c287b89dc7db89e18305377847e246095", "ja": "（朋花のステージが終わった。\n今日も、声援がすごいな！）", "zh": "（朋花的表演结束了。\n今天观众的声援也很热烈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0102_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ec639a631140dd2bdaf740e0086439d6b337fae6393ed0ff680593bdd9337a45", "ja": "朋花、お疲れさま。\n今日のステージ、盛り上がったな！", "zh": "朋花，辛苦你了。\n今天的表演盛况空前喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0102_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "6a30bc5b0609b01488120b2e4ce4b2f5b3b01c82e3ff791b7f32fcc385f5bb17", "ja": "ええ、ステージからも見えていましたよ～。\n聖母を仰ぎ見る子豚ちゃん達、幸せそうでした～。", "zh": "是啊，我在舞台上也看见了～\n仰望圣母的小猪们，看起来都很幸福呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0102_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7e0eb2121b6e8f5f40713297c9919a55ffb90f912119f141a38231e7f7b71504", "ja": "そうだな。ステージ袖から見るお客さ……\n子豚ちゃん達も、みんな笑顔だったよ。", "zh": "是啊。我在舞台侧边也能看到观……\n小猪们笑得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0102_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "9847f3054afdf00d5abc61a8541839bcd5f2fd39f2e56731eea94a0f40a46cd5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、知っていますか～？\n聖母が笑顔なら、子豚ちゃんも笑顔になるんですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你知道吗～？\n只要圣母面带微笑，小猪们也会跟着露出笑容喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0102_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "c6072b78bdf020cb5630fe5919d8bccb8aa62cb4679b501cb0b7cf5dd4b2bb3b", "ja": "子豚ちゃんたちの笑顔を見守るのが、\n聖母の役割ですからね～。", "zh": "而守望小猪们的笑容，\n就是圣母的职责喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0102_1006_p", "source_sha256": "972703d0ce90acaea2d1f2d860ab71b0e5ac674c800f54c010d5ae34561719a5", "ja": "それなら、子豚ちゃん達の笑顔のためにも……\nまずは朋花に笑顔になってもらわないとだな。", "zh": "既然如此，为了看到小猪们的笑脸……\n得先让朋花展露笑容才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0102_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "3c88fe5ef75d74c0b44ee01d85ca332bd7984d180b7d7f6fa990fe5b31a50426", "ja": "そういうことです～。\n理解が早い方は、嫌いじゃありませんよ～。", "zh": "一点也没错～\n脑筋转得快的人，我不讨厌喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0102_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "eae844e6119ebffc12cb0fbec8522ca2f3e090550198ee600b2f90ae744a68ca", "ja": "というわけで……{$P$}さん、\nこれからも、私に尽くしてくださいね～♪", "zh": "所以……{$P$}先生，\n以后也请你继续为我奉献心力了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
